title: "Mitsubishi Mini-Split Controller"
abstract: "Unofficial Python controller for Mitsubishi mini-split heat pumps on the Kumo Cloud / Mitsubishi Comfort app cloud. It keeps the unit in heat and steers the setpoint toward a target to reduce overshoot and temperature swings compared with Auto mode."
type: software
